BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 760 Td (X200 Router User Manual) Tj T* () Tj T* (Page 1 - Getting started) Tj T* (Connect the WAN port to your modem with the included cable.) Tj T* (Power on the router and wait for the status LED to turn solid white \(about 2 minutes\).) Tj T* (Open the admin console at http://192.168.1.1 and sign in with the password) Tj T* (printed on the label under the router.) Tj T* (Firmware 3.2 and later use http://router.local instead \(see the release notes\).) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
