6 0 obj
<< /Length 351 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 760 Td (Page 2 - Status LED) Tj T* () Tj T* (Solid white: connected to the internet.) Tj T* (Pulsing white: starting up or updating firmware. Do not unplug.) Tj T* (Solid amber: no internet connection. Check the modem and the WAN cable.) Tj T* (Blinking red: an error. Read the code in the admin console \(see page 3\).) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
