stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 760 Td (Page 3 - Error codes) Tj T* () Tj T* (E101 - Overheating. Move the router to a ventilated place; it restarts when cool.) Tj T* (E204 - WAN link down. The modem is not responding. Restart the modem, then the router.) Tj T* (E310 - Firmware verification failed. Download the firmware again and retry the update.) Tj T* (E415 - Too many devices. The X200 supports up to 128 connected devices.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
