stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 760 Td (Page 4 - Reset and firmware) Tj T* () Tj T* (Restart: hold the reset button for 3 seconds.) Tj T* (Factory reset: hold the reset button for 15 seconds until the LED blinks amber.) Tj T* (A factory reset erases all settings, including Wi-Fi names and passwords.) Tj T* (Firmware updates are installed from Settings > Firmware > Check for updates.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
