BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 760 Td (Page 5 - Specifications and warranty) Tj T* () Tj T* (Wi-Fi 6E tri-band \(2.4, 5 and 6 GHz\), up to 5.4 Gbps combined.) Tj T* (Ports: one 2.5 Gbps WAN port, four 1 Gbps LAN ports, one USB-C port.) Tj T* (Coverage: up to 2,500 square feet.) Tj T* (Warranty: 2 years limited hardware warranty from the date of purchase.) Tj T* ET
endstream
